	quest.8EC4A70000001001.quest_desc: [
		"Wildwood is the DivineRPG realm immediately after Eden. Throw an Eden Heart into Divine Flame, then right-click that flame with a Frozen Clock set to early afternoon. This is a different calibration from the midday clock used for Eden."
		"Defeat the Sunstorm and keep its Wildwood Heart. It will make the Artisan Relic obtainable later in this path."
	]
